              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule id="9a29-1b6a-42c3-01e5" name="Raven Guard" hidden="false">
                  <description>Loyalist Legion.
Adds: Destroyer Detachment; Dark Fury Squad; Mor Deythan Strike Detachment; Legion Storm Eagle Attack Wing; Corvus Corax, the Shadow Lord.
Replaces or removes the core Legion Destroyer Detachment; Legion Storm Eagle Attack Wing.
Cohesive allies: Legio Custodes.
Disruptive allies: Imperial Militia, Solar Auxilia, Knight Household, Mechanicum Taghmata, Legio Titanicus.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="77a9-c6f5-a8a7-eec3" name="Salamanders" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
