        <characteristic name="Firepower" typeId="d5dc-a6b1-1fdc-bb30">(assault weapons) MW&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AP4+&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AP5+/AT5+&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AP5+/AT6+&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AP4+/AT5+&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AP5+/AT6+&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AP5+/AT5+&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AT4+&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;AP5+</characteristic>
