        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="072f-7f4a-18eb-925e">Invulnerable Save, Walker. A Contemptor Dreadnought must select two arm mounted weapons at no extra cost before the start of the game. A Contemptor Dreadnought may take a carapace mounted Havoc Launcher at an extra 5 pts per unit.</characteristic>
